From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:19:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(google): accept loopback redirects on any port

Google lets installed apps redirect to a loopback IP address on whatever
port they listen on (RFC 8252 section 7.3), so a registered
http://127.0.0.1 redirect must match http://127.0.0.1:<port>.
